  "ingredients": [
    "6 large apples, cored and diced",
    "1 cup diced rhubarb",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1.75 cups quick cooking oats",
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "1 cup chilled butter, cut into pieces",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Butter a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kDEArz2wz3VCNc2AUbcD2U7utsA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-222268-apple-rhubarb-crisp-step-01-3c1a79f1255741f3b785633e010ae8c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222268/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix apples, rhubarb, 1 cup white sugar, 1/4 cup flour, and 1 teaspoon cinnamon in a bowl until thoroughly combined. Spread fruit mixture into the bottom of the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Hwl8DYBrc-QsKa75On5lQkdxL24=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-222268-apple-rhubarb-crisp-step-02-f9c210b3fe0840799161a7d8a8bf1849.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222268/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix oats, remaining 1 ½ cups flour, and brown sugar in a separate bowl; cut in butter until crumbly. Spread evenly over fruit mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ma0I0oZY1ymwfiadaQobye38F28=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-222268-apple-rhubarb-crisp-step-03-9339617623d940f8999d9a83a49cf409.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222268/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 2 tablespoons white sugar with remaining 1/2 teaspoon cinnamon in a small bowl; sprinkle over oat topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iII5wUPm53G5RPGyPBWyyICqK3Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-222268-apple-rhubarb-crisp-step-04-527203adf06347e7b7849fc7fbbd3eb3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222268/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until fruit is bubbling and thick and topping is golden brown, about 45 minutes. Let cool 10 to 15 minutes, then serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e3bIlWW-W5dMvv9tfvZFHarHuWA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-222268-apple-rhubarb-crisp-step-05-1756c6126eb5438e973e3afdc60b53f4.jpg"
